+## Agent profiling
+
+For AgentProf recordings from Pi, Claude Code, Codex or Muse:
+
+*   **Slow run or unfamiliar recording:** [Investigate a run]($SKILL_ROOT/workflows/agentprof/investigate_agent_run.md).
+*   **Response latency and token throughput:** [Model performance]($SKILL_ROOT/workflows/agentprof/analyze_model_performance.md).
+*   **Slow tools, scripts or child agents:** [Tools and delegation]($SKILL_ROOT/workflows/agentprof/analyze_tools_and_delegation.md).
+*   **Context growth or compaction:** [Context pressure]($SKILL_ROOT/workflows/agentprof/analyze_context_pressure.md).
+*   **Before/after or harness/model comparisons:** [Compare runs]($SKILL_ROOT/workflows/agentprof/compare_agent_runs.md).
+*   **Recorded process CPU/RSS/heap:** [Runtime resources]($SKILL_ROOT/workflows/agentprof/correlate_runtime_resources.md).
